 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・品種: 夏の暑さで葉がかなり傷み花も止まるので、その時点で強く切り戻す（新しい葉と返り咲き）。Walters: 真夏に乱れたら刈る",
  "management_type_quote": "As the heat of the summer sets in, foliage tends to decline considerably and flowering slows down or stops entirely, at which point plants should be cut back hard.",
